---METADATA---
TARGET: packages/nextjs/utils/customChains.ts
DESCRIPTION: Define Flow EVM chain configurations for mainnet and testnet
DEPENDENCIES: none
PRIORITY: high
---END_METADATA---

Create a TypeScript file that defines custom Flow EVM chain configurations using viem's `defineChain` function.

Requirements:
- Import `defineChain` from "viem"
- Export `flowMainnet` chain with:
  - id: 747
  - name: "Flow EVM Mainnet"
  - nativeCurrency: { name: "Flow", symbol: "FLOW", decimals: 18 }
  - rpcUrls.default.http: ["https://mainnet.evm.nodes.onflow.org"]
  - blockExplorers.default: { name: "Flowscan", url: "https://evm.flowscan.io" }

- Export `flowTestnet` chain with:
  - id: 545
  - name: "Flow EVM Testnet"
  - nativeCurrency: { name: "Flow", symbol: "FLOW", decimals: 18 }
  - rpcUrls.default.http: ["https://testnet.evm.nodes.onflow.org"]
  - blockExplorers.default: { name: "Flowscan Testnet", url: "https://evm-testnet.flowscan.io" }
  - testnet: true

The file should be properly typed and follow Scaffold-ETH 2 conventions.
